, {"file_name": "ZeroCaliber2_Screenshot05.png", "id": "239766985659915", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75334066_239766988993248_484809953301683563_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i9qwEEPt1a4Q7kNvwGRKj6-&_nc_oc=AdohakkMdk1FxEJJK1TAPpfmE9ok9u4Bg6S-US7H1UgEH74u0d1FfDZAgpDQilvN-3E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN8m1f9Kw7wXrPJTtEl8E0KPlvbXkftQI3eeaVuth8-rQ&oe=6ACCE97A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ZeroCaliber2_CoverArt_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "219203984540676", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984447_219203987874009_6483626324491434520_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UJ0Zv0wWSRYQ7kNvwHS9-Xg&_nc_oc=Adpa-PRtGHplxVEUKL4J-UBsu9sfurz7YWeLVGixpJmeD0R2Ovf8q2VK50V2ueo_ORI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN0P9WV_qg9uDp8QaZBelmyppPdEexkTjSB5A0kxhNo5Q&oe=6ACD005A"}, "display_name": "Zero Caliber 2", "keywords": ["coop", "shooter", "story", "military", "campaign"], "long_description": "We can't save the world alone, the OSA needs you soldier - enlist NOW by wishlisting Zero Caliber 2 in the Meta Quest store! \n\n### THE SEQUEL ###\n\nYour favorite all-in-one VR FPS made infinitely better! Get ready to experience the thrill of your virtual life in Zero Caliber 2, the sequel to our critically acclaimed Zero Caliber: Reloaded military shooter! \n\nCinematic action, explosions, tons of weapons to unlock, a full-blown single player/Co-op campaign (taking place after the events of the prequel), PvP, native mod support, zombies, airstrikes, more explosions and a VR experience you'll never forget! \n\nComing to your Meta Quest in 2024.\n\n### COMMUNITY ###\n\nTo participate in future playtests, catch sneak peeks and behind the scenes, join our awesome community on Discord: \n-> discord.gg/xrealgames <- \n\nAnd follow us on: \n- Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/XREALGamesVR\n- X: ht